OL,5,G1900 Tom Read Wilson's Grand Tour
OL,6,     FTom follows in the steps of 17th,
OL,7,     F18th and 19th-century aristocrats
OL,8,     Fon their Grand Tours of Europe. In
OL,9,     FParis, he takes in Notre-Dame and
OL,10,     Fthe Gardens of Versailles.
OL,11,G2000 Corsica: Jewel of the Med
OL,12,     F'The island of beauty' boasts 600
OL,13,     Fmiles of coast, lush forests, and
OL,14,     Fmountains. In Bastia, Canistrelli
OL,15,     Fbiscuits draw in crowds, while
OL,16,     FNapoleon's statue is restored in
OL,17,     FAjaccio.
